Scope and provenance
--------------------
These files are a STRUCTURED DERIVATIVE of assessment results published by the
protocol authority on its public pages. They are not the raw records.

  * vehicle model names, manufacturer names and source URLs are removed
  * each record is identified only by an opaque variant_id
  * the raw scrape and the protocol documents are NOT redistributed here,
    because their licensing is not ours to grant

Anyone reusing these files should cite the accompanying paper and should obtain
the underlying assessment results from the protocol authority directly if the
raw records are required.
